<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Toronto Poster Columns &mdash; Import Chunks</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../index.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../gaps/gaps.css">
<link rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css"
      integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY="
      crossorigin="">
<script defer src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"
        integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo="
        crossorigin=""></script>
<script defer src="import.js"></script>
<script data-goatcounter="https://osm-toronto.goatcounter.com/count" async src="//gc.zgo.at/count.js"></script>
<style>
  #gap-table td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .steps { margin: .6rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .steps li { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .tags { display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .6rem; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .tags strong { display: block; font-size: .85rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="app">

<header class="bar">
  <div class="bar-head">
    <h1>Toronto Poster Columns &mdash; import chunks</h1>
    <a class="back" href="../">&larr; reference layer</a>
    <a class="back" href="../gaps/">&larr; gaps</a>
  </div>
  <div class="counts">
    <div class="count missing"><strong>{{NODE_COUNT}}</strong><span>new nodes</span>
      <em>{{COLUMN_NODES}} columns &middot; {{BOARD_NODES}} boards</em></div>
    <div class="count"><strong>{{CHUNK_COUNT}}</strong><span>chunks</span>
      <em>at most {{MAX_PER_CHUNK}} nodes each</em></div>
    <div class="count"><strong>{{REMOVED_COUNT}}</strong><span>left out</span>
      <em>missing, but temporarily removed</em></div>
    <div class="count meta-count">City data {{DATA_DATE}} &middot; OSM data {{OSM_DATE}} &middot; built {{BUILD_DATE}}</div>
  </div>
  {{OSM_NOTE}}
  <p class="licence">
    <a href="{{LICENSE_URL}}">{{LICENSE_NOTICE}}</a>
    Sources: <a href="{{COLUMN_DATASET}}">Poster Structure</a>,
    <a href="{{BOARD_DATASET}}">Poster Board</a>.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="layout">
  <div id="gap-map" data-geojson="chunks.geojson"></div>

  <aside class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <div class="controls">
        <span class="kinds">
          <label><input type="checkbox" data-kind="column" checked> Columns</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" data-kind="shelter_board" checked> Shelter boards</label>
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">
        The City points with nothing in OSM within {{FAR_M}}&nbsp;m, cut into
        geographically compact chunks of up to {{MAX_PER_CHUNK}}, one
        changeset each. Points listed as <em>far</em> or <em>duplicate</em>
        on the gap page already have an OSM feature and are not here, nor is
        a missing point the City lists as temporarily removed. Columns and
        shelter boards are chunked apart, so either can be imported without
        the other. Chunks are recut from the gap list at every weekly build:
        reopen this page before starting one. The import's community review
        is not done here: this page is the technical half only.
      </p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>Start JOSM with <em>Preferences &rarr; Remote Control</em> on.</li>
        <li><strong>1&nbsp;load</strong> opens the chunk as a new layer, with
            the changeset comment and tags set.</li>
        <li><strong>2&nbsp;context</strong> adds, to that layer, the existing
            OSM boards, advertising and shelters in the chunk's box, from
            Overpass.</li>
        <li>Check the new nodes against imagery and the validator, then upload.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="tags">
        <div><strong>Column nodes</strong>{{COLUMN_TAGS}}</div>
        <div><strong>Shelter board nodes</strong>{{BOARD_TAGS}}</div>
        <div><strong>Changeset</strong>{{CHANGESET_TAGS}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table id="gap-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Chunk</th><th>Nodes</th><th class="col-name">Extent</th>
              <th>JOSM</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
{{CHUNK_ROWS}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

</body>
</html>
